This plugin orchestrates existing third-party tools (the `magento2-lsp`
MCP server, the `gh` CLI, standard shell utilities, and an LLM via the
Claude Code runtime). None of those tools are bundled or redistributed
in this repository — consumers install them themselves.

pb-codegraph is the companion plugin to pb-graphiti
(https://github.com/ProxiBlue/pb-graphiti), with separated concerns:

  * pb-codegraph — code structure + blast radius (what calls what)
  * pb-graphiti — intent + why (decision history, vendor verdicts)

See README.md for full design notes and the roadmap to a deterministic
tree-sitter symbol graph in v0.2+.
